{"title":"Thak Shieldbearer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 56 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/thak-shield-boss\">Thak Shield Boss</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1643.1px,-3083.4px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:2816px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/12.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:3072px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/6/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:2816px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/6/12.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:3072px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/7/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:2816px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/7/12.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:3072px\"><i style=\"left:1633.5px;top:3075.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1652.8px;top:3091.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Old Thak Muster Ground</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"thak-shieldbearer\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Thak: <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman\">Thak Spearman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\">Thak Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">Thak Veteran</a> <span class=\"muted\">(68)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-warlord\">Thak Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(75)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/e7e01251516d28eabcfa.svg\" alt=\"Thak Shieldbearer\"></div><h3>Thak Shieldbearer</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>56 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 56–56)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Thak</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>389</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>35.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2800</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}